cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code in your research, please cite the software release
  and, when available, the associated peer-reviewed article.
title: 'Mechanistic modelling of Plasmodium vivax transmission and insecticide-treated net effects'
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Otolorin
    given-names: Gbeminiyi Richard
abstract: >-
  R source code for a deterministic human-mosquito Plasmodium vivax
  transmission model, calibration to an insecticide-treated net trial,
  likelihood profiling, sensitivity analyses and forward projections.
keywords:
  - Plasmodium vivax
  - mechanistic modelling
  - insecticide-treated nets
  - malaria
  - R
  - Guatemala
